 "en": "<div><article> <div class=\"api-body\"> <section class=\"short-description\"> <p data-tid=\"b1\">Decorator that assigns metadata to the class/function using the specified <code>key</code>.</p> <p><a href=\"#description\" data-tid=\"b0\">See more...</a></p> </section> <pre class=\"language-typescript\"><code language=\"ts\" hidecopy=\"true\" class=\"language-typescript no-box api-heading\">\nconst <a href=\"#/api/common/SetMetadata\" class=\"code-anchor highlight\">SetMetadata</a>: &lt;K = string, V = any&gt;(metadataKey: K, metadataValue: V) =&gt; <a href=\"https://api-references-nestjs.netlify.app/api/common/CustomDecorator\" class=\"code-anchor highlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CustomDecorator</a>&lt;K&gt;;</code></pre> <section class=\"see-also\"> <h3 id=\"see-also\" data-tid=\"b2\"><span>See also</span></h3> <ul> <li><p><a href=\"https://docs.nestjs.com/fundamentals/execution-context#reflection-and-metadata\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reflection</a></p> </li> </ul> </section> <section class=\"description\"> <h3 id=\"description\" data-tid=\"b3\"><span>Description</span></h3> <p data-tid=\"b4\">Requires two parameters:</p> <ul> <li data-tid=\"b5\"><code>key</code> - a value defining the key under which the metadata is stored</li> <li data-tid=\"b6\"><code>value</code> - metadata to be associated with <code>key</code></li> </ul> <p data-tid=\"b7\">This metadata can be reflected using the <code><a href=\"#/api/core/Reflector\" class=\"code-anchor highlight\">Reflector</a></code> class.</p> <p data-tid=\"b8\">Example: <code>@<a href=\"#/api/common/SetMetadata\" class=\"code-anchor highlight\">SetMetadata</a>('roles', ['admin'])</code></p> </section> </div> </article> </div>",
